ditor is a floating window.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a Control node\n2. Add script editor to that node\n3. In the Control node add a theme resource file or create directly in the Control node\n4. Select the Control node and go to the script editor\n5. Press Enter to jump to a new line\n6. Focus should switch directly to the theme editor\n7. The focus change issue happens also if pressing the backspace button\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[focus-issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24015019/focus-issue.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113704/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113704/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}